WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

4
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

5
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 31=

6
01:39.400 --> 01:40.000
Yan Shang,

7
01:40.840 --> 01:43.230
you made such bold promises,

8
01:43.680 --> 01:46.640
yet failed to serve me with all your loyalty and ability.

9
01:47.480 --> 01:49.230
You've failed to live up to my expectations.

10
01:50.840 --> 01:51.230
I

11
01:51.790 --> 01:52.310
admit my guilt.

12
01:53.480 --> 01:54.920
The corruption in Lingnan

13
01:55.840 --> 01:57.510
was practically out in the open.

14
01:57.950 --> 01:59.510
Yet you claim you found nothing.

15
02:00.760 --> 02:04.120
How do I know you haven't colluded with those corrupt officials

16
02:04.560 --> 02:05.640
and submitted a false report?

17
02:06.280 --> 02:07.310
For such gross negligence,

18
02:08.150 --> 02:09.960
even stripping you of your post and executing you

19
02:10.470 --> 02:11.400
wouldn't be too harsh.

20
02:12.030 --> 02:12.590
Father!

21
02:22.400 --> 02:23.080
However,

22
02:23.800 --> 02:25.400
I've decided to show you mercy.

23
02:26.240 --> 02:27.840
I'll grant Wanyao's request

24
02:28.630 --> 02:29.870
and banish you from Sheng'an,

25
02:30.560 --> 02:31.750
never to return.

26
02:32.590 --> 02:33.520
Go to Lanyang.

27
02:34.470 --> 02:35.430
Serve as county magistrate.

28
02:40.310 --> 02:40.800
Yan Shang,

29
02:42.000 --> 02:42.520
thank His Majesty.

30
03:06.710 --> 03:07.310
(Today)

31
03:08.120 --> 03:09.120
(may be our final farewell.)

32
03:10.360 --> 03:11.750
(But as long as you choose life, there's hope.)

33
03:13.430 --> 03:14.710
(Locked in this gilded cage,)

34
03:15.870 --> 03:17.360
(all by myself.)

35
03:18.240 --> 03:18.960
(And that's enough.)

36
03:23.680 --> 03:24.400
(Stay alive,)

37
03:25.470 --> 03:25.960
(Yan Shang.)

38
03:29.520 --> 03:31.480
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger; Households, Land, Taxes)

39
03:33.680 --> 03:34.430
What's this?

40
03:37.680 --> 03:38.150
Your Majesty,

41
03:39.310 --> 03:40.590
I've reconstructed from memory

42
03:41.470 --> 03:43.240
three years of financial records from Lingnan Circuit.

43
03:50.240 --> 03:50.870
Bring it here.

44
03:54.740 --> 03:55.980
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger; Households, Land, Taxes)

45
04:10.740 --> 04:15.960
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger; Households, Land, Taxes)

46
04:18.680 --> 04:20.190
You wrote all this from memory?

47
04:20.680 --> 04:21.430
I reconstructed this ledger

48
04:22.190 --> 04:23.870
from memory while in prison.

49
04:24.830 --> 04:26.120
Jiang Heng, Military Commander of Lingnan,

50
04:26.750 --> 04:28.750
secretly conspired with the Crown Prince and funneled him money.

51
04:29.310 --> 04:31.800
Under the guise of public works, he enriched himself.

52
04:32.920 --> 04:33.800
Across 93 counties,

53
04:34.360 --> 04:35.390
fields lie barren and granaries stand empty.

54
04:36.070 --> 04:38.040
People sell their wives and children, yet still can't pay their taxes.

55
04:38.870 --> 04:40.070
Bones lie scattered across the countryside,

56
04:40.920 --> 04:41.950
yet the authorities still demand forced labor.

57
04:47.560 --> 04:48.480
I humbly beg Your Majesty

58
04:48.950 --> 04:50.160
to execute these corrupt officials

59
04:50.750 --> 04:53.240
and bring peace to Lingnan's countless innocent souls!

60
04:59.580 --> 05:01.820
(Previous Grain Balance: 4,200 shi; New Receipts: 2,800 shi)

61
05:07.510 --> 05:10.000
With nothing but your eyes and memory,

62
05:10.800 --> 05:12.070
you remembered all of this?

63
05:13.000 --> 05:13.480
Father!

64
05:14.750 --> 05:15.390
He's lost his mind!

65
05:15.680 --> 05:17.510
He's scribbled all this without a shred of evidence.

66
05:18.190 --> 05:19.070
How can you believe him?

67
05:19.270 --> 05:21.950
I ask Your Majesty to choose any year, prefecture, or county

68
05:22.870 --> 05:24.240
and investigate whatever you wish.

69
05:25.070 --> 05:25.870
Whether I've fabricated anything

70
05:26.720 --> 05:27.480
will be clear once the records are compared.

71
05:28.390 --> 05:28.750
Very well.

72
05:30.190 --> 05:33.000
I'll summon those involved for questioning

73
05:33.680 --> 05:34.310
and verify

74
05:35.270 --> 05:36.390
every page of these records.

75
05:38.070 --> 05:39.510
Then when you said

76
05:40.390 --> 05:41.240
disaster relief had been ineffective

77
05:41.920 --> 05:43.510
and your inspection had uncovered nothing,

78
05:44.480 --> 05:45.830
you were lying to me?

79
05:55.600 --> 05:56.480
Take Yan Shang

80
05:58.160 --> 05:59.240
back to the Imperial Prison.

81
05:59.600 --> 06:00.070
- Yes, Your Majesty! - Yes, Your Majesty!

82
06:19.830 --> 06:20.480
Wanyao,

83
06:21.480 --> 06:23.950
it seems he really doesn't want to go to Lanyang.

84
06:33.630 --> 06:34.070
Stop!

85
06:36.120 --> 06:36.630
Move!

86
06:44.270 --> 06:44.800
Yan Shang,

87
06:45.870 --> 06:47.310
do you think you're some kind of hero?

88
06:49.390 --> 06:50.270
Let me tell you something.

89
06:52.160 --> 06:53.390
You're

90
06:54.830 --> 06:55.750
the stupidest,

91
06:56.600 --> 06:57.360
cruelest,

92
06:58.160 --> 06:59.430
most self-righteous man in the world!

93
07:03.070 --> 07:03.600
I'm sorry.

94
07:04.430 --> 07:05.560
What did I tell you?

95
07:08.310 --> 07:09.510
What did you promise me?

96
07:11.600 --> 07:12.720
Why did you lie to me?

97
07:14.870 --> 07:15.390
Yan Shang,

98
07:16.360 --> 07:17.270
I've always despised

99
07:18.680 --> 07:19.680
betrayal above all else.

100
07:20.460 --> 07:24.300
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

101
07:26.320 --> 07:32.430
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - Let grief drown in your eyes♪

102
07:33.980 --> 07:36.951
♪- Soar with the wind; - Plunge into hellfire as one♪

103
07:36.951 --> 07:38.809
♪Burning bright as a song♪

104
07:38.851 --> 07:42.241
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

105
07:42.860 --> 07:46.120
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

106
07:48.150 --> 07:51.520
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

107
07:52.780 --> 07:54.979
♪Not a single hour less♪

108
07:55.021 --> 08:01.731
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

109
08:02.580 --> 08:05.900
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

110
08:06.100 --> 08:09.569
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

111
08:09.611 --> 08:16.211
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

112
08:16.830 --> 08:18.469
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

113
08:18.511 --> 08:21.251
♪- May time be free of pain; - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

114
08:21.300 --> 08:23.420
♪You're the only one I need♪

115
08:24.080 --> 08:30.850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

116
08:31.230 --> 08:34.350
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

117
08:34.760 --> 08:36.640
♪My last untouched innocence♪

118
09:02.480 --> 09:03.390
By imperial decree!

119
09:03.790 --> 09:06.790
Princess Danyang is to reside at Lizheng Hall for the time being.

120
09:25.980 --> 09:26.820
(Jiang Heng Colluded with the Crown Prince to transfer funds)

121
09:27.360 --> 09:28.600
(Du Ping, Transport Commissioner of Lingnan,)

122
09:29.030 --> 09:30.320
(falsified disaster relief expenses.)

123
09:32.420 --> 09:33.660
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping)

124
09:34.600 --> 09:35.430
(Labor-tax cloth:) Pei Xuanming,

125
09:35.430 --> 09:36.550
(2,000 bolts due, 1,600 received;) Director of the Bureau of Operations

126
09:36.840 --> 09:37.910
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming) accepted bribes from the Crown Prince.

127
09:38.960 --> 09:40.200
(Wang Heling, Vice Minister of Revenue,)

128
09:40.440 --> 09:41.790
(falsified salt and iron tax records.)

129
09:42.540 --> 09:43.540
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming; Cheng An)

130
09:58.140 --> 10:00.841
(Wei Feng, Cao Jiashi, Zhang Ran, Liu Mingzheng, Liu Lingming, Liu Dong,)

131
10:00.841 --> 10:01.780
(Zhou Dewei, Wang Jianian)

132
10:01.900 --> 10:04.940
(Funds transferred to the Crown Prince's household.)

133
10:12.510 --> 10:13.080
What's the current

134
10:13.840 --> 10:15.440
troop deployment at Anwu Gate?

135
10:15.600 --> 10:16.240
Rest assured, Your Royal Highness.

136
10:16.960 --> 10:18.000
By the third quarter of the Yin hour tomorrow,

137
10:18.240 --> 10:19.240
all the Jinwu Guards at Anwu Gate

138
10:19.480 --> 10:20.510
will have been replaced by our men.

139
10:20.910 --> 10:21.910
For now, the only troops we can rally

140
10:22.390 --> 10:23.630
are from the Shence Army's Right Battalion.

141
10:24.510 --> 10:25.059
Then we can...

142
10:25.101 --> 10:25.651
Who dares barge in?

143
10:31.200 --> 10:31.550
Your Royal Highness.

144
10:32.480 --> 10:33.150
It's too late.

145
10:34.720 --> 10:35.480
By imperial command,

146
10:35.870 --> 10:38.080
I must escort the Crown Prince to Liangyi Hall immediately.

147
10:38.550 --> 10:39.320
As for everyone else,

148
10:39.840 --> 10:40.550
arrest them all!

149
10:41.840 --> 10:42.200
Your Royal Highness!

150
10:42.320 --> 10:42.630
Your Royal Highness!

151
10:42.720 --> 10:43.219
- Move! - Hurry up!

152
10:43.261 --> 10:43.539
Your Royal Highness!

153
10:43.580 --> 10:43.829
Move!

154
10:43.871 --> 10:44.539
Your Royal Highness!

155
10:44.581 --> 10:45.701
- Move! - Save me, Your Royal Highness!

156
10:45.790 --> 10:47.150
Your Royal Highness!

157
10:47.630 --> 10:48.600
Your Royal Highness!

158
10:49.320 --> 10:50.000
Your Royal Highness.

159
10:51.670 --> 10:52.240
This way, please.

160
10:55.080 --> 10:55.440
Take a look.

161
11:02.720 --> 11:03.720
Apart from these people,

162
11:03.940 --> 11:05.580
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming)

163
11:07.600 --> 11:08.630
have I missed anyone?

164
11:14.100 --> 11:14.740
(Liu Mingzheng; Liu Lingming; Wang Jianian)

165
11:18.720 --> 11:19.630
Xun,

166
11:20.840 --> 11:23.030
don't you owe me an explanation?

167
11:28.120 --> 11:28.960
Father,

168
11:30.390 --> 11:32.000
if I'd had nothing at my disposal,

169
11:32.910 --> 11:33.390
how could I

170
11:33.840 --> 11:35.480
have rescued you from Yu Cheng'an

171
11:35.960 --> 11:37.200
at the hunting grounds that day?

172
11:42.200 --> 11:42.750
Father,

173
11:44.720 --> 11:45.630
all these years,

174
11:46.790 --> 11:47.720
I've lived in constant fear for my life.

175
11:48.720 --> 11:50.200
Right under Yu Cheng'an's nose,

176
11:50.480 --> 11:51.840
I risked my neck recruiting troops and forging armor.

177
11:53.270 --> 11:54.750
Why do you think I did all that?

178
11:56.000 --> 11:57.550
Don't you understand, Father?

179
12:27.480 --> 12:27.840
Get up.

180
12:43.120 --> 12:44.480
But Yu Cheng'an

181
12:45.550 --> 12:47.200
was executed over a month ago.

182
12:48.720 --> 12:50.320
Why have you never submitted

183
12:51.080 --> 12:52.200
an official report on the funds, provisions,

184
12:53.270 --> 12:55.720
and private troops under your command?

185
12:59.670 --> 13:00.360
Why?

186
13:16.960 --> 13:17.840
Xun,

187
13:20.670 --> 13:23.080
that sword you turned against Yu Cheng'an...

188
13:24.720 --> 13:25.360
Will you

189
13:27.600 --> 13:30.600
turn it against your own father tomorrow?

190
13:51.840 --> 13:53.390
Since you've already made up your mind,

191
13:54.910 --> 13:55.960
why bother asking?

192
14:01.670 --> 14:02.840
You brought me

193
14:03.270 --> 14:04.360
here today

194
14:05.550 --> 14:06.630
and demanded an explanation.

195
14:08.360 --> 14:10.720
You just wanted to humiliate me again, didn't you?

196
14:16.790 --> 14:18.030
Just like

197
14:22.030 --> 14:24.030
Yu Cheng'an did back then.

198
14:27.480 --> 14:28.120
How dare you!

199
14:42.550 --> 14:43.440
Father,

200
14:44.630 --> 14:45.750
the two of us...

201
14:47.200 --> 14:48.790
What a ridiculous pair we are.

202
14:51.270 --> 14:52.720
Absolutely ridiculous!

203
15:00.060 --> 15:06.300
(Universe in Harmony)

204
15:06.420 --> 15:07.700
(Lizheng Hall)

205
15:42.320 --> 15:42.720
(Your Highness,)

206
15:43.600 --> 15:44.550
(those commanders)

207
15:45.240 --> 15:46.360
(merely fear the Crown Prince's power.)

208
15:46.910 --> 15:48.030
(Do you think they're truly loyal?)

209
15:49.270 --> 15:50.510
(They're not men who would die for you.)

210
15:50.840 --> 15:51.840
(They're predators who would turn on their own master.)

211
15:52.320 --> 15:53.360
(They're not your allies,)

212
15:53.670 --> 15:54.910
(but the very men who could bring about your death.)

213
15:55.960 --> 15:56.870
(Those who bargain with tigers)

214
15:57.320 --> 15:58.270
(ultimately become their prey.)

215
15:59.320 --> 16:00.200
(As time goes on,)

216
16:00.840 --> 16:02.440
(I fear you'll sink into the same mire.)

217
16:03.320 --> 16:04.510
(How would you be any different from the Crown Prince?)

218
16:09.510 --> 16:10.200
That's true.

219
16:12.200 --> 16:14.030
To fight my way out of this swamp,

220
16:16.270 --> 16:17.840
I'm bound to get covered in mud

221
16:18.720 --> 16:19.510
and resort to whatever it takes.

222
16:24.510 --> 16:26.440
But I won't become as rotten as they are.

223
16:33.670 --> 16:34.360
(In the end,)

224
16:35.390 --> 16:35.870
(Yan Shang,)

225
16:37.120 --> 16:38.150
(you still don't believe in me.)

226
16:39.360 --> 16:41.120
(You don't believe I can forge my own path,)

227
16:42.150 --> 16:42.910
(or that I)

228
16:43.840 --> 16:45.150
(can survive without bowing to anyone.)

229
16:48.320 --> 16:48.750
Hurry up!

230
17:01.630 --> 17:02.200
Keep moving!

231
17:05.920 --> 17:06.200
Hurry up!

232
17:06.640 --> 17:07.070
Keep moving!

233
17:09.510 --> 17:10.310
Keep up! Keep up!

234
17:13.030 --> 17:13.960
Yan Shang!

235
17:17.240 --> 17:19.030
I never thought I'd run into someone I know in here.

236
17:21.110 --> 17:23.590
I didn't expect His Majesty to act so quickly either.

237
17:24.830 --> 17:25.440
I suppose

238
17:26.000 --> 17:27.270
the officials in Lingnan and other circuits

239
17:27.480 --> 17:28.720
who had secret dealings with the Crown Prince

240
17:29.400 --> 17:30.510
have been dealt with by now.

241
17:31.200 --> 17:31.550
You...

242
17:35.480 --> 17:36.809
I still don't understand

243
17:36.851 --> 17:37.741
what you're trying to achieve.

244
17:38.350 --> 17:39.510
You'd already made it back alive.

245
17:39.750 --> 17:40.680
All you had to do was keep quiet,

246
17:40.920 --> 17:42.160
and neither of us would be in this prison!

247
17:42.510 --> 17:43.030
Yang Si,

248
17:44.440 --> 17:45.750
when I first came to Sheng'an,

249
17:46.550 --> 17:47.880
I never expected to return home alive.

250
17:48.920 --> 17:49.350
And now,

251
17:50.680 --> 17:51.310
nothing has changed.

252
17:55.480 --> 17:55.790
Move!

253
18:13.000 --> 18:15.440
(Serene and Content) Your Majesty confined the Crown Prince.

254
18:16.270 --> 18:18.720
What do you intend to do with Meng Zaishi?

255
18:22.030 --> 18:24.899
There's one major difference between Meng Zaishi

256
18:24.941 --> 18:26.501
and Meng Baiyu and Mu Xianqing.

257
18:27.640 --> 18:28.510
Do you know what it is?

258
18:29.550 --> 18:31.030
I've heard something about it.

259
18:31.880 --> 18:33.480
The soldiers under Meng Zaishi

260
18:33.680 --> 18:35.480
would all lay down their lives for him.

261
18:36.480 --> 18:40.310
He united the Central Circuit in remarkably little time,

262
18:41.400 --> 18:42.310
not because

263
18:43.480 --> 18:45.350
he is a Meng,

264
18:46.000 --> 18:46.750
but because of

265
18:47.550 --> 18:50.160
how he leads his troops and treats his men.

266
18:52.350 --> 18:52.960
Exactly.

267
18:54.070 --> 18:55.790
The Central Circuit's forces

268
18:56.720 --> 18:59.310
have effectively become Meng Zaishi's private army.

269
19:00.880 --> 19:01.920
But as long as

270
19:02.310 --> 19:04.310
he remains here in Sheng'an,

271
19:05.350 --> 19:07.310
his loyal soldiers

272
19:08.240 --> 19:10.270
won't dare make a move against me.

273
19:12.200 --> 19:13.510
Your Majesty is wise.

274
19:14.350 --> 19:15.720
With one man in your hands,

275
19:16.240 --> 19:17.480
you can control an entire army.

276
19:19.110 --> 19:20.200
However...

277
19:24.110 --> 19:24.510
What is it?

278
19:26.070 --> 19:27.350
I just wonder

279
19:28.200 --> 19:29.960
how long this can last...

280
19:32.240 --> 19:32.720
Your Majesty!

281
19:35.750 --> 19:36.720
It's nothing.

282
19:42.400 --> 19:44.440
Perhaps I've overworked myself these past few days.

283
19:44.830 --> 19:45.200
I'm tired.

284
19:46.110 --> 19:47.400
I'll go and rest.

285
19:51.550 --> 19:51.920
General,

286
19:52.510 --> 19:53.550
I've brought the pastries you asked for.

287
20:21.020 --> 20:24.460
(The ambush is in position.)

288
21:26.110 --> 21:26.440
Here they come!

289
21:26.590 --> 21:27.729
They should be cut to pieces!

290
21:27.771 --> 21:29.421
(Wontons; Flatbread) It's them! Look at those people!

291
21:29.510 --> 21:30.440
They deserve to be cut to pieces!

292
21:31.310 --> 21:31.659
Keep moving!

293
21:31.701 --> 21:32.331
They deserve to die!

294
21:32.440 --> 21:32.859
Exactly!

295
21:32.901 --> 21:33.771
They never did anything good!

296
21:34.310 --> 21:34.960
Bad people!

297
21:35.310 --> 21:36.289
(Bamboo Goods Shop) Kid, come here!

298
21:36.331 --> 21:36.629
Come here!

299
21:36.671 --> 21:37.061
Bad people!

300
21:37.160 --> 21:37.790
Where are your parents?

301
21:38.030 --> 21:39.550
They starved to death because of them!

302
21:40.720 --> 21:41.699
How does dirt taste?

303
21:41.741 --> 21:42.331
You corrupt officials!

304
21:42.680 --> 21:43.830
Corrupt officials! Scoundrels!

305
21:45.480 --> 21:45.830
Stand back!

306
21:46.240 --> 21:46.680
Stand back!

307
21:47.550 --> 21:48.000
Get back!

308
21:49.720 --> 21:50.400
Move along! Hurry!

309
21:50.640 --> 21:51.960
Everyone, calm down!

310
21:52.680 --> 21:53.400
Please, stay calm!

311
21:54.000 --> 21:54.699
Everyone, calm down!

312
21:54.741 --> 21:55.371
Make way! Move aside!

313
21:56.480 --> 21:56.899
Make way!

314
21:56.941 --> 21:57.461
Get lost!

315
21:57.550 --> 21:58.440
Back! Move back!

316
22:02.960 --> 22:03.680
- Xiaozhou's back! - Father!

317
22:04.000 --> 22:04.350
Brother!

318
22:06.480 --> 22:08.240
Something's happened!

319
22:08.680 --> 22:09.270
What happened?

320
22:09.400 --> 22:10.160
Wonderful news!

321
22:10.480 --> 22:11.270
Wonderful news?

322
22:11.640 --> 22:12.070
Father,

323
22:12.400 --> 22:13.750
I heard the court sent troops

324
22:14.000 --> 22:15.640
to arrest the Military Governor of Lingnan.

325
22:16.160 --> 22:18.400
Nearly all the corrupt officials have been arrested too.

326
22:18.960 --> 22:19.960
When I went to the county market,

327
22:20.200 --> 22:22.270
I saw lots of people who'd fled the famine

328
22:22.440 --> 22:24.110
returning home in groups.

329
22:24.830 --> 22:25.640
And when I got into town,

330
22:26.000 --> 22:27.750
I saw a notice posted at the city gate.

331
22:29.550 --> 22:30.310
What did it say?

332
22:30.590 --> 22:33.310
New disaster relief funds will arrive within a month.

333
22:33.590 --> 22:35.590
They'll review land records and return land to the people,

334
22:35.790 --> 22:37.400
and give landless refugees plots to cultivate.

335
22:37.590 --> 22:38.030
And...

336
22:39.720 --> 22:41.400
There'll be no taxes for three years.

337
22:43.720 --> 22:44.590
Three years!

338
22:48.550 --> 22:49.200
It was Shang.

339
22:55.240 --> 22:56.270
Shang did this!

340
23:14.920 --> 23:15.400
Wanyao.

341
23:22.070 --> 23:22.790
Your Majesty.

342
23:29.480 --> 23:30.030
What?

343
23:30.790 --> 23:31.790
Are you angry

344
23:32.000 --> 23:32.750
because I made you reflect on your actions?

345
23:37.160 --> 23:38.350
Everything Yan Shang wrote

346
23:38.790 --> 23:39.720
has been verified.

347
23:40.310 --> 23:43.480
Chancellor Liu said hardship had strengthened his resolve.

348
23:44.310 --> 23:45.070
He was right.

349
23:49.750 --> 23:50.480
Just look at you.

350
23:51.070 --> 23:52.049
You were so picky,

351
23:52.091 --> 23:53.771
and look who you ended up with.

352
23:54.440 --> 23:55.480
How foolish!

353
23:56.270 --> 23:58.979
Even as the husband of an ordinary woman,

354
23:59.021 --> 24:01.461
he'd never put his wife and children first.

355
24:01.720 --> 24:03.030
How could he possibly be

356
24:03.270 --> 24:05.030
a suitable husband for a princess of Huai?

357
24:06.030 --> 24:06.480
Your Majesty,

358
24:07.830 --> 24:08.750
I've already given up on him.

359
24:10.920 --> 24:11.270
Sit down.

360
24:17.510 --> 24:17.960
Wanyao,

361
24:18.480 --> 24:19.440
do you remember

362
24:20.070 --> 24:21.070
the story I once told you

363
24:21.960 --> 24:23.030
about Zhuangzi's

364
24:24.590 --> 24:26.400
useless tree?

365
24:27.790 --> 24:28.350
Being useless

366
24:28.920 --> 24:30.270
is what saves it from the axe.

367
24:31.200 --> 24:34.000
If you could simply be content as a princess

368
24:34.830 --> 24:36.030
and stop meddling in things,

369
24:37.790 --> 24:39.270
you could keep yourself safe.

370
24:43.000 --> 24:43.830
That night at the hunting grounds,

371
24:45.000 --> 24:46.590
my own safety never crossed my mind.

372
24:52.200 --> 24:55.920
You're the second person to bring up that night with me.

373
24:57.680 --> 24:58.400
Do you think

374
24:59.590 --> 25:01.350
I'm also trying to claim credit and beg for mercy?

375
25:03.550 --> 25:06.480
If all women were this sharp-tongued,

376
25:06.750 --> 25:08.440
they'd only invite trouble.

377
25:16.830 --> 25:17.920
Think of your mother.

378
25:18.640 --> 25:21.030
How magnificent she looked drawing her bow!

379
25:21.960 --> 25:24.790
And look how she ended up.

380
25:30.070 --> 25:30.920
Weapons like these

381
25:32.160 --> 25:34.070
can't protect a woman.

382
25:34.830 --> 25:37.030
They only bring deadly trouble upon her.

383
25:37.880 --> 25:38.920
Being gentle and yielding

384
25:39.510 --> 25:40.830
is the key to survival.

385
25:41.680 --> 25:43.310
Remember when you were little?

386
25:45.240 --> 25:47.400
You were gentle, sweet, and sensible.

387
25:48.270 --> 25:50.590
If you could be like that again,

388
25:51.510 --> 25:52.720
obedient and well-behaved,

389
25:53.550 --> 25:55.110
I would protect you

390
25:55.680 --> 25:56.400
and cherish you.

391
25:57.960 --> 25:59.240
Just keep your hands

392
25:59.960 --> 26:01.270
away from things

393
26:02.110 --> 26:03.550
you have no business touching.

394
26:06.750 --> 26:07.640
What happened to the Crown Prince?

395
26:10.480 --> 26:11.510
Huai

396
26:12.070 --> 26:13.070
no longer has a Crown Prince.

397
26:19.400 --> 26:20.440
You're different from him.

398
26:21.400 --> 26:23.440
You're my precious daughter.

399
26:24.400 --> 26:26.750
Now that Yan Shang is gone,

400
26:27.480 --> 26:29.200
you can continue living in the palace.

401
26:29.880 --> 26:30.790
What's more,

402
26:31.680 --> 26:34.310
I've even made the best arrangements for you.

403
26:37.000 --> 26:37.310
No.

404
26:39.640 --> 26:40.590
I want to return to my residence.

405
26:42.110 --> 26:44.249
Your residence has no guards now.

406
26:44.291 --> 26:45.221
Don't go back.

407
26:45.750 --> 26:46.550
Stay here

408
26:47.480 --> 26:48.680
and keep me company.

409
26:50.880 --> 26:51.590
Back then,

410
26:52.350 --> 26:53.590
for the stability of Huai,

411
26:54.070 --> 26:55.880
you agreed to marry the Military Commander of the Central Circuit.

412
26:57.110 --> 26:58.179
Now, Meng Zaishi...

413
26:58.221 --> 26:59.021
I won't do it!

414
27:04.750 --> 27:05.720
Why not?

415
27:06.310 --> 27:07.769
Meng Zaishi is in his prime,

416
27:07.811 --> 27:09.261
and he's devoted to you.

417
27:09.440 --> 27:10.880
Back then, I only gave in to Yu Cheng'an

418
27:11.400 --> 27:13.030
for your sake and Mother's.

419
27:13.680 --> 27:14.350
And now,

420
27:14.830 --> 27:16.350
my own father is the one forcing me.

421
27:18.030 --> 27:19.569
Oh, you silly girl!

422
27:19.611 --> 27:20.981
How is that the same?

423
27:21.960 --> 27:22.920
Back then, you had to marry

424
27:23.270 --> 27:26.000
and moved far away to the bitter cold of the Central Circuit.

425
27:26.750 --> 27:27.270
But now,

426
27:28.000 --> 27:29.550
Meng Zaishi is at the palace.

427
27:31.030 --> 27:32.750
I won't allow him to leave Sheng'an.

428
27:33.200 --> 27:34.750
You want us both to become

429
27:35.440 --> 27:37.350
a pair of declawed, defanged playthings

430
27:37.640 --> 27:38.510
for your amusement?

431
27:38.750 --> 27:39.400
Do as you're told!

432
27:53.830 --> 27:54.440
Be obedient.

433
27:54.960 --> 27:57.110
You're my precious daughter.

434
27:57.510 --> 27:58.440
As your father, I'll

435
27:59.350 --> 28:00.310
arrange your marriage

436
28:01.640 --> 28:02.350
and grant you both

437
28:02.960 --> 28:03.960
the right to settle in Sheng'an.

438
28:11.070 --> 28:12.750
A wolf will never become a vegetarian.

439
28:14.440 --> 28:15.640
He won't agree.

440
28:19.000 --> 28:20.480
He already has.

441
28:59.030 --> 28:59.680
What rotten luck!

442
29:00.200 --> 29:01.270
What's with all this spooky behavior?

443
29:04.680 --> 29:05.350
Excuse me.

444
29:06.590 --> 29:07.350
Is today

445
29:08.030 --> 29:09.110
the fifteenth?

446
29:10.680 --> 29:11.790
What time is it?

447
29:15.030 --> 29:16.160
Can't you see that huge moon?

448
29:21.160 --> 29:21.920
It's just past the hour of Hai.

449
30:19.240 --> 30:20.200
That physician

450
30:21.270 --> 30:22.590
was right after all.

451
30:25.720 --> 30:28.160
General Meng has been granted the title of Prince Consort.

452
30:28.680 --> 30:31.310
His Majesty asks Your Highness to make preparations.

453
30:31.680 --> 30:34.160
The wedding will take place in three days.

454
30:36.310 --> 30:38.310
How could he agree to such humiliation?

455
30:39.830 --> 30:40.590
He's lost his mind.

456
30:41.960 --> 30:43.859
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices and the Court of State Ceremonial

457
30:43.901 --> 30:45.771
are urgently working out the wedding arrangements.

458
30:46.440 --> 30:47.510
What does the Court of State Ceremonial have to do with this?

459
30:48.160 --> 30:49.350
Because the Prince Consort

460
30:49.790 --> 30:51.680
made a request of His Majesty.

461
31:00.440 --> 31:01.830
Your Majesty has shown me boundless generosity

462
31:03.720 --> 31:04.920
by granting me the Princess's hand.

463
31:06.640 --> 31:08.070
I'm deeply humbled.

464
31:09.920 --> 31:11.000
I have only one wish.

465
31:12.030 --> 31:13.790
I humbly ask Your Majesty to grant it.

466
31:16.720 --> 31:18.480
For my wedding to Princess Danyang,

467
31:19.510 --> 31:22.880
I ask that we follow the wedding customs of both Sheng'an and North Jing equally.

468
31:25.350 --> 31:27.880
For this is not merely a celebration for my family.

469
31:29.640 --> 31:32.480
It is an honor for all three military districts of North Jing.

470
31:36.000 --> 31:36.939
The wedding protocol

471
31:36.981 --> 31:39.331
must be revised by both courts and the Ministry of Rites.

472
31:39.920 --> 31:40.400
However,

473
31:41.110 --> 31:43.960
the ceremonial robes, headdress, and jewelry for Your Highness

474
31:44.350 --> 31:45.350
are already prepared.

475
31:46.720 --> 31:47.160
Come in!

476
32:00.140 --> 32:01.480
(Suicheng)

477
32:01.480 --> 32:06.040
(Wenmo Pavilion; Suicheng; Inn)

478
32:16.110 --> 32:16.590
Sir!

479
32:17.830 --> 32:18.310
Sir!

480
32:27.160 --> 32:27.830
My master...

481
32:29.270 --> 32:30.720
He's been dismissed and imprisoned.

482
32:31.590 --> 32:32.480
All his family's land and property

483
32:33.270 --> 32:34.350
have been confiscated.

484
32:34.550 --> 32:35.440
If I'd been any later,

485
32:36.110 --> 32:37.440
I wouldn't have escaped,

486
32:37.790 --> 32:39.680
and I'd never see you again.

487
32:47.960 --> 32:48.590
Take your time.

488
32:50.000 --> 32:51.030
Tell me everything from the beginning.

489
33:07.550 --> 33:08.550
Master left a message.

490
33:09.160 --> 33:10.350
He said the Liu family's downfall

491
33:11.110 --> 33:12.830
is all Yan Shang the Collator's doing.

492
33:13.200 --> 33:13.750
That is,

493
33:14.400 --> 33:16.240
your former classmate, sir.

494
33:38.960 --> 33:39.590
Now,

495
33:40.510 --> 33:42.070
the entire Liu family is ruined.

496
33:45.350 --> 33:46.110
He said

497
33:47.510 --> 33:48.400
only you

498
33:50.200 --> 33:51.880
can avenge the Liu family.

499
34:33.840 --> 34:34.230
Shang.

500
34:36.190 --> 34:36.630
It's me.

501
34:38.920 --> 34:39.550
Wenji.

502
34:55.190 --> 34:56.110
I've wronged you.

503
35:04.230 --> 35:05.030
Why do you say that?

504
35:06.960 --> 35:07.840
The Lingnan case...

505
35:10.840 --> 35:12.360
It's mostly been settled by now, hasn't it?

506
35:14.360 --> 35:15.030
Your family...

507
35:20.230 --> 35:21.150
You can't manage that yourself, can you?

508
35:22.230 --> 35:22.710
I'll feed you.

509
35:29.230 --> 35:29.710
I'm sorry.

510
35:46.320 --> 35:47.000
My family is ruined.

511
35:50.710 --> 35:51.190
I know.

512
36:05.550 --> 36:06.190
This medicine

513
36:07.320 --> 36:08.480
improves circulation and reduces bruising.

514
36:08.960 --> 36:09.710
It's very effective.

515
36:15.230 --> 36:16.000
Wenji.

516
36:21.550 --> 36:22.110
Thank you.

517
36:47.630 --> 36:48.000
Shang,

518
36:53.230 --> 36:54.880
I've been in the palace long enough.

519
36:57.150 --> 36:58.510
Do you think I can't see what's happening?

520
37:00.800 --> 37:02.360
His Majesty was the one who sent you to Lingnan.

521
37:05.150 --> 37:06.670
The moment he made that decision,

522
37:09.400 --> 37:10.480
my family was already doomed.

523
37:15.840 --> 37:17.760
If this is the outcome His Majesty wanted,

524
37:20.000 --> 37:20.840
then it wouldn't matter

525
37:23.230 --> 37:23.920
who he sent.

526
37:27.550 --> 37:29.550
Even if he'd sent me,

527
37:33.440 --> 37:35.630
I'd have had no choice but to put justice above family.

528
37:37.670 --> 37:38.360
Wenji...

529
38:05.840 --> 38:06.510
What happened to your eyes?

530
38:08.630 --> 38:09.510
While I was in Lingnan,

531
38:10.150 --> 38:11.280
I had a little accident.

532
38:12.840 --> 38:13.590
I've lost my sight.

533
38:14.710 --> 38:15.230
Don't worry.

534
38:16.070 --> 38:16.880
I'll find a way to help.

535
38:18.150 --> 38:19.150
I'll get an imperial physician to see you.

536
38:22.510 --> 38:23.230
No need.

537
38:24.190 --> 38:25.000
That won't be difficult to arrange.

538
38:30.630 --> 38:32.110
His Majesty doesn't want you dead yet.

539
38:48.320 --> 38:49.190
There's something else

540
38:50.190 --> 38:51.150
you probably don't know.

541
38:56.190 --> 38:57.670
His Majesty has arranged a marriage.

542
38:59.030 --> 39:00.030
Meng Zaishi

543
39:01.280 --> 39:02.840
is to marry Princess Danyang.

544
39:34.190 --> 39:35.070
We're stuck again?

545
39:37.760 --> 39:38.480
I'll get out and take a look.

546
39:38.880 --> 39:39.360
Pacification Commissioner,

547
39:41.070 --> 39:41.960
you may have to get out.

548
39:43.150 --> 39:44.070
I'm afraid

549
39:44.760 --> 39:45.590
we can't go any farther.

550
39:52.020 --> 39:56.660
(North Jing)

551
40:07.880 --> 40:09.360
General Meng can't come back,

552
40:09.880 --> 40:11.000
so they sent you instead?

553
40:12.590 --> 40:14.110
They claim to have a written order.

554
40:15.000 --> 40:15.440
Show me!

555
40:26.150 --> 40:27.550
(An Shahe, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard) All is well.

556
40:28.400 --> 40:30.070
I'll return soon.

557
40:37.190 --> 40:38.739
Didn't that darned emperor say the same thing

558
40:38.781 --> 40:40.091
when he let you return?

559
40:40.360 --> 40:41.630
It's all just empty promises!

560
40:44.000 --> 40:45.590
General Meng wrote this himself!

561
40:46.000 --> 40:47.630
Do you think he'd be pleased to hear you say that?

562
40:48.960 --> 40:50.360
I also have a decree from His Majesty.

563
40:53.400 --> 40:54.590
When Yu's faction plotted rebellion,

564
40:55.110 --> 40:56.000
the imperial court was thrown into chaos.

565
40:56.280 --> 40:57.590
You led the Gray Wolf Cavalry

566
40:57.920 --> 40:58.880
and rushed to my rescue.

567
40:59.150 --> 41:00.110
What that means is,

568
41:00.440 --> 41:02.920
Yu Cheng'an was terrible when he controlled the court,

569
41:03.440 --> 41:05.190
but General Meng saved His Majesty

570
41:05.480 --> 41:06.070
and rendered great service.

571
41:06.920 --> 41:07.510
He is hereby promoted

572
41:07.840 --> 41:09.440
to Commander of All Military Affairs in North Jing,

573
41:09.840 --> 41:10.510
with a fief yielding revenue

574
41:11.070 --> 41:11.630
from 500 households.

575
41:12.670 --> 41:13.190
In short,

576
41:13.630 --> 41:15.030
His Majesty has rewarded him generously

577
41:15.510 --> 41:17.320
and invited him to stay at the palace a little longer.

578
41:20.320 --> 41:20.590
You...

579
41:20.710 --> 41:21.880
I get it now!

580
41:21.960 --> 41:24.230
That darned emperor is holding General Meng hostage!

581
41:25.000 --> 41:27.169
No! General Meng will come back!

582
41:27.211 --> 41:27.901
When will he be back?

583
41:28.190 --> 41:29.070
Is that up to you?

584
41:29.590 --> 41:30.880
No, wait! Let him go first!

585
41:31.070 --> 41:31.760
Let him go!

586
41:31.880 --> 41:33.840
Let go! Let go!

587
41:34.630 --> 41:35.630
Let go!

588
41:38.550 --> 41:39.000
What do we do?

589
41:39.880 --> 41:41.070
The general must be in danger.

590
41:41.360 --> 41:42.590
(Gu Han, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard) Muster the troops! We march now!

591
41:42.920 --> 41:43.550
As for these two,

592
41:44.190 --> 41:44.800
kill them now!

593
41:46.110 --> 41:46.960
Go ahead and march!

594
41:47.480 --> 41:48.880
You'll be the ones who get General Meng killed!

595
41:49.110 --> 41:50.230
General Meng gave no such order,

596
41:50.630 --> 41:51.760
yet you're mobilizing troops without his permission.

597
41:52.150 --> 41:53.590
Are you really worried about his safety,

598
41:54.110 --> 41:55.569
or are you trying to seize his position in the chaos?

599
41:55.611 --> 41:56.941
Nonsense!

600
41:58.320 --> 42:00.110
If you're truly concerned for General Meng's safety,

601
42:00.360 --> 42:01.480
then let him finish!

602
42:03.070 --> 42:04.760
If His Majesty really intended to kill General Meng,

603
42:05.110 --> 42:06.550
why would he send us with a message?

604
42:07.320 --> 42:09.320
To invite North Jing's army to lay waste to Sheng'an?

605
42:12.840 --> 42:13.840
Mu Xianqing is dead.

606
42:14.710 --> 42:17.070
All of North Jing now follows General Meng's command.

607
42:17.880 --> 42:19.230
With 100,000 soldiers under his command,

608
42:19.480 --> 42:20.920
if His Majesty were to kill him,

609
42:21.480 --> 42:22.960
wouldn't he fear a rebellion in North Jing?

610
42:24.280 --> 42:25.030
He's the top scholar!

611
42:25.360 --> 42:27.230
All he knows is reading classics and writing essays.

612
42:27.590 --> 42:28.670
He couldn't even kill a chicken!

613
42:29.070 --> 42:29.819
He brought only me, a defenseless woman,

614
42:29.861 --> 42:31.051
to deliver this message,

615
42:31.360 --> 42:32.190
without a single armed soldier.

616
42:32.710 --> 42:34.960
Doesn't that prove Huai's sincerity?

617
42:40.360 --> 42:41.590
That emperor is cunning.

618
42:42.280 --> 42:43.920
He sent these two helpless lambs here.

619
42:44.550 --> 42:46.320
Who knows what he's really plotting?

620
42:46.590 --> 42:47.070
Kill them!

621
42:47.550 --> 42:48.710
General Meng is unharmed for now,

622
42:49.440 --> 42:50.590
but his life truly hangs by a thread!

623
42:50.840 --> 42:51.190
What?

624
42:53.030 --> 42:54.230
Every word I've said is true.

625
42:54.590 --> 42:55.710
Think carefully, and you'll understand.

626
42:56.030 --> 42:56.960
What His Majesty fears

627
42:57.320 --> 42:58.070
isn't General Meng himself,

628
42:58.920 --> 43:00.360
but another Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors.

629
43:01.280 --> 43:02.670
As long as you hold your positions here,

630
43:03.150 --> 43:03.670
the court

631
43:04.280 --> 43:05.760
won't dare lay a finger on General Meng.

632
43:06.960 --> 43:08.400
None of that matters!

633
43:08.800 --> 43:09.800
Just answer me!

634
43:10.150 --> 43:12.710
Why is that emperor holding General Meng?

635
43:13.550 --> 43:14.360
Isn't it obvious?

636
43:14.710 --> 43:16.880
General Meng is a hostage now!

637
43:20.150 --> 43:21.000
Which means,

638
43:21.670 --> 43:23.190
the person most afraid of anything happening to him

639
43:23.800 --> 43:24.480
isn't any of you,

640
43:25.440 --> 43:26.630
but the Emperor of Huai.

641
43:47.630 --> 43:48.710
Take them away

642
43:49.230 --> 43:49.670
and get them settled.

643
45:00.340 --> 45:04.780
(Next Episode Preview)

644
45:05.630 --> 45:06.840
Don't let your general down.

645
45:07.510 --> 45:08.800
Don't let him die for nothing!

646
45:10.150 --> 45:10.960
I'm going back

647
45:11.670 --> 45:12.670
to demand justice

648
45:13.230 --> 45:14.230
for General Meng.

649
45:15.510 --> 45:18.400
Princess Danyang has returned from North Jing.

650
45:21.481 --> 45:24.774
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

651
45:27.459 --> 45:32.375
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

652
45:34.569 --> 45:40.414
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

653
45:40.914 --> 45:46.140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

654
45:48.909 --> 45:53.700
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

655
45:54.536 --> 46:00.615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

656
46:02.416 --> 46:05.566
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

657
46:05.566 --> 46:07.214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

658
46:07.266 --> 46:10.990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

659
46:11.368 --> 46:16.034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

660
46:16.653 --> 46:20.694
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

661
46:21.185 --> 46:23.300
♪Not a single hour less♪

662
46:23.340 --> 46:30.286
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

663
46:31.049 --> 46:34.502
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

664
46:34.682 --> 46:37.827
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

665
46:38.266 --> 46:44.903
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

666
46:45.300 --> 46:47.338
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

667
46:47.338 --> 46:49.814
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

668
46:49.852 --> 46:52.321
♪You're the only one I need♪

669
46:52.525 --> 46:59.412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

670
46:59.724 --> 47:02.995
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

671
47:03.300 --> 47:06.473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

672
47:06.797 --> 47:10.223
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

673
47:10.456 --> 47:13.681
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

674
47:14.012 --> 47:20.808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

675
47:21.177 --> 47:23.239
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

676
47:23.240 --> 47:25.743
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

677
47:25.790 --> 47:28.128
♪You're the only one I need♪

678
47:28.359 --> 47:35.194
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

679
47:35.543 --> 47:37.161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

680
47:37.291 --> 47:39.087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

681
47:39.444 --> 47:42.461
♪You're the only one I need♪

682
47:42.501 --> 47:43.828
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)

683
